      {
        "author_name": "Andre Remillard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101313581857939457366/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocISk2fqqSD93U5xcqv0UKR21tHNr9NBnbaCiCMQKntn99KoeQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Had urinary tract infection 2 weeks ago. Gave me antibiotics. Still have infection trying to get another appointment. It is unbelievable 30 minutes on hold. I guess the only way is maybe go there in person. Maybe I might be lucky and get an appointment",
        "time": 1756935755,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Smily Emmy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100061763334539418704/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUq5kH-9eOy9INkKxXwrHHWqh4kA6yIHurNLVvo48ZDdavl8E2_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I want to say thank you for offering appointments even if I had to book online. This past week I had a problem with my ear, the nurse asked me the right questions to understand what the problem was and the doctor was right. My ears were filled with water. I was prescribed a nasal spray which I have been using since Thursday but I want to say thank you for seeing me when you can. My doctor recently retired but I did go online and register for a new doctor and I hope that I get one at this clinic Again thank you so much ☺️",
        "time": 1753569138,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jonaralaw Transport Inc",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112774954609191714939/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKWtETqMYmXlMboutQbXzET240doyMF7kZY6MReI9FhC6u0fQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Almost impossible to get an appointment with our family doctor. My wife was injured and they kept hanging up the phone  as soon as you call without even answering. When I finally did talk to someone and I explained that we need an injury looked at she told me to call back some other time when she's  not busy. They don't care about their patients at all.",
        "time": 1753104361,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rosine R. (Roro)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104368344433220361144/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX1RqRexy5DiNJp1CcZCrwNGPIwTbSyZ5eyqpNLiLpNKn33wrlf=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Really nice service.  Each time I go there , I always have a super great service 🤩. I love I can schedule my appointment in advance 😄.  And if anything happen  I call to reschedule.",
        "time": 1741856368,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tyler Cardille",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113669557183705731753/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIm6f8VZi1gBAKHt2RqeSYTyih6INDV2Xvo3TOLkErw31kMHw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Horrible experience. I need an urgent diagnosis for my throat which is causing excruciating pain and they said they only take appointments. I asked if there are any cancellations and they told me to check the website myself because they won’t do it for me. I asked if I could stay there and see a doctor for just two minutes: any time today is fine and they completely shut me down very rudely. The service was awful.",
        "time": 1728477167,
        "translated": false
      }
